>
> First, the player picks up a number of Ring dice ( (ring) ) equal to their character’s ring the GM chose. This can be found on the character sheet under Rings.
>
> Next, the player picks up a number of Skill dice ( (skill) ) equal to their character’s ranks in the skill the GM chose.
>
> Then, the player rolls all of the dice together.
