> **Resolve Symbols on Kept Dice**
>
> The player resolves symbols from results of kept dice in the following order to determine the check's outcome:
>
> - Explosive Success ((ex)): For each (ex), the player may roll 1 extra die of the type on which it appears and choose to keep or drop it.
> - Strife ((st)): The character receives 1 strife per (st).
> - Opportunity ((op)): Spend (op) to add story details.
