> **CRANE SCHOOLS**
>
> The Crane Clan is concerned foremost with preserving Rokugani culture and ensuring civility in the courts. To that end, the schools of the Crane Clan inculcate proper decorum in all their students regardless of their primary curriculum, so much so that Crane are sometimes perceived as priggish or haughty by members of other clans. Crane samurai are also expected to have at least a basic appreciation for the arts if they are not artisans themselves.

