> **DRAGON SCHOOLS**
>
> Ostensibly, the Dragon Clan’s chief aim is to record and reflect upon the happenings of the Emerald Empire, but others wonder if there is some other objective the Dragon are pursuing in secret. The schools of the Kitsuki and the Agasha train their scholars, investigators, and shugenja to perceive the natural world and classify their observations, while the teachings of the Mirumoto and Togashi dōjō seem more concerned with individual Enlightenment, whether through the sword or the soul. All Dragon samurai emphasize individuality, however, and there is often more variety among the students within the same Dragon school than there is between students of different schools in the other clans.

