> **HONORED ANCESTORS**
>
> Your character has countless ancestors, and there are thus any number of individuals whose spirits they could summon. However, to be considerate of your group’s time, you should prepare the profile and a brief overview personality of any ancestor you wish to summon in advance.
>
> While roleplaying an ancestor, remember that you are portraying that individual (rather than your usual character) and they might have a different agenda and desires!

