> **SCORPION SCHOOLS**
>
> The Scorpion are loyal and pragmatic above all, and so their schools teach absolute loyalty to the clan as much as they teach the means by which the clan achieves its ends. The differences between appearances and reality, lies and truths, suspicion and trust—and more importantly, how and when to use which—are all driven home in their students, point by painful point.

