> **PLAYING A RONIN**
>
> The rōnin path provided here represents a character who was born into one of the Great Clans, but for reasons that are up to you, has since left their clan to become a masterless warrior. To make a rōnin character, you should choose the clan and family that your character originated from, then chose this school (which, in this case, is more of a collection of worldly experiences than a true school).
