##### Painful Honesty (Air)

A popular, if bawdy, song at many roadside inns in Rokugan, “The Honest Husband” is the story of a staunch-hearted farmer who can never tell a lie. The song progresses through several verses where he is faced with questions from his wife about her weight, the attractiveness of her sister, and other increasingly risky (and risqué) situations. The song’s refrain of “you know I love you, dearest, but I cannot tell a lie” has become on its own a catchphrase, used jokingly when a person is asked difficult questions.

