| Getting someone to sell you an item at a 10% discount (Water), cooking a pleasant meal (Water), knowing the route another ship captain will take (Air), clandestinely observing an average mark for a day to get information about their habits (Air), finding enough food to sustain yourself for several days in the forest (Water). | 2 |
