> **HONOR AND INVOCATIONS**
>
> Some invocations may allow or even encourage a PC to behave dishonorably. With the Mask of Wind, for example, one could impersonate someone of higher status, and Secrets on the Wind would allow a character to eavesdrop effortlessly on their own lord.
>
> The GM should remind players that their characters must still forfeit or stake honor to commit acts that defy the tenets of Bushidō, even when they are using mystical powers to enact their plots.

