> **MAHŌ IN CURRICULUMS**
>
> Mahō do not appear in any curriculums of upstanding samurai schools. If such dark secrets did appear in a curriculum table, they would be marked with a stylized oni's head ((maho)) .

> **MAHŌ EFFECT KEYWORDS**
>
> Each mahō contains one or more italicized keywords in its effects. These are a reminder of how the mahō functions, and some abilities refer to them. The ones in this book include:
>
> Augment: Mahō that change or bolster their targets
>
> Curse: Mahō that incites the wrath of evil spirits on their targets
>
> Summon: Mahō that calls forth foul Shadowlands beings

