##### Rounds

##### Mass Battle Actions

In addition to these sample actions, characters can also perform actions created for the circumstances by their players (and approved by the GM) or actions that have been granted to them by their techniques and abilities.

##### Resolving a Mass Battle

A mass battle can end in a number of ways, such as:

- Strategic Victory/Defeat: If an army succeeds in achieving the Seize Victory! strategic objective, it wins the mass battle at the end of the round (and any other armies involved lose). The winning army can be assumed to achieve the goals for which it took the field, such as driving the enemy out of a region, capturing a particular location, or making a show of force. Participating armies that did not fall prey to a rout or morale collapse withdraw relatively intact.

