> **WHAT IS LEFT UNSAID**
>
> Sometimes, the only honest and honorable path is to say nothing at all. A samurai’s word is always good, and if a samurai says they will do something, they will do it or die trying. The wise pay attention, therefore, to what a samurai does not say, for in these gaps many important truths can be found.

