> **EXPERIENCED PCS (OPTIONAL RULE)**
>
> GMs who want to give their players more options to start can always have their PCs begin with XP and even titles based on the sorts of characters they want them to be able to build at the outset. A few potential starting points are:
>
> Young Heroes: +10 XP
>
> Seasoned Retainers: +30 XP
>
> Veteran Samurai: +50 XP, one appropriate title such as Emerald Magistrate

